  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support EcoContact</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d EcoContact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Civil Society Organisation EcoContact. The support aims to strengthen the organization and contribute to their activities. The core support activities includes the five programs run by EcoContact:

-	Create an environmentally resposnsible society
-	Implementation of the Aarhus Convention
-	Sustainable development with a focus on green economy, climate change/DRR, waste/chemical management.
-	Environmental legislation
-               Organizational Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till den Moldaviska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationen EcoContact. St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xe4;rka organisationen och bidra till deras verksamhet genom flexibel finansiering som kan anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r b&#xe5;de projekt och l&#xf6;pande kostnader f&#xf6;r verksamheten. K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;deverksamheten innefattar utvecklande och st&#xe4;rkande av EcoContact&apos;s fyra program: 

-Create an environmentally responsible society
-Implementation of the Aarhus Convention
-Sustainable development with a focus on green economy, climate change/DRR, waste/chemical management.
-Environmental legislation
-               Organizational Development</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EcoContact focuses its activity on three main strategic directions and the fourth dimension is specifically dealing with the organizational development, as follows:
A. Implementation of the Aarhus Convention on Access to Information, Public Participation in Decision-Making and Access to Justice on Environmental Matters.
B. Sustainable development with a focus on: Green Economy, Climate Change/DRR, Waste/Chemical Management Water, Environmental Education.
C. Environmental legislation; and
D. Organizational development.</narrative>
  </description>
